    "notes": "set-tower (S7), from rift-b's Phase 0 clone of the Arc 1 seams floor. West wall x=11, z 13-22 (columns), y 5..2 (rows, top first). '*' = scars, walkable in the grid: (y2,z14) is Hitmonlee's scar (it cracks underfoot, and the ghost act kicks it shut), (y2,z20-21) the false seam (the step hook drops you). The true seam climbs to y3 at the fork (z19) and comes down at z22. Ghost-prop groups: 2 the scar's loose rocks (shown until Hitmonlee kicks it shut), 3 Vespiquen's light in front of the true seam (hidden until lit), 4 the four stepping stones east of the deeper ledge (hidden until Lapras lifts them), 0 everything else (B1F's decor, the false seam's rocks, and Cyrus's island: a medium floating platform at (39,22)). Arc2DwLostTower_HandleFrame / _HandleStep in src/overlay009/ov9_02249960.c drive the groups and the acts.",
